# Osiris Designer File menu popup placement smoke.
#
# motion uses host-screen coords. macOS shifts the SDL content area
# down by ~28 px (title bar); Xvfb has no decoration, so host-screen
# y=28 lands on the toolbar instead of the menubar. target-motion
# resolves against the registered replay-target window (the Designer
# top-level), so the same numbers hit the same widgets on either
# host.
delay 5000
wait-window "Qt Designer by Trolltech" 5000
screenshot initial 0 0 940 740
target-motion 36 8
button 1 press
delay 200
target-motion 36 50
delay 1000
screenshot file-menu 0 0 940 740
assert-image file-menu osiris-designer-menu.json
button 1 release
